=== Computing Pseudorandom Sequence ===

The problem involves:
1. Generating a long pseudorandom sequence using a specific PRNG
2. Converting the generated numbers to text/characters
3. Searching for specific patterns or computing statistics

Typical computational approach:
- Run the PRNG for N steps (N may be up to 10^12 or more)
- Use pattern matching (KMP, Aho-Corasick, etc.)
- Exploit the periodic nature of the PRNG
- Use cycle detection (Floyd's algorithm) for optimization

